@startuml container-architecture
!include _style.puml
title TutorMatching - Container Architecture
left to right direction

actor User
component "React Web\n:3000" as Web
component "YARP Gateway\n:8080" as Gateway

package "Bounded-context services" {
  component "Identity\n:8080" as Identity
  component "Tutor\n:8080" as Tutor
  component "Student\n:8080" as Student
  component "Scheduling\nCore Domain :8080" as Scheduling #FFF1E6
  component "Notification\n:8080" as Notification
}

database "IdentityDb" as IdentityDb
database "TutorDb" as TutorDb
database "StudentDb" as StudentDb
database "SchedulingDb\nBooking + Outbox" as SchedulingDb #FFF1E6
database "NotificationDb\nInbox + Reminder" as NotificationDb
queue "Redis\nHold TTL 300s" as Redis
queue "RabbitMQ\nTopic events" as Rabbit

User -[#2E5AA8]-> Web : HTTPS
Web -[#2E5AA8]-> Gateway : /api/v1
Gateway -[#2E5AA8]-> Identity
Gateway -[#2E5AA8]-> Tutor
Gateway -[#2E5AA8]-> Student
Gateway -[#2E5AA8]-> Scheduling
Gateway -[#2E5AA8]-> Notification
Identity --> IdentityDb
Tutor --> TutorDb
Student --> StudentDb
Scheduling --> SchedulingDb
Scheduling --> Redis
Scheduling -[#2E5AA8]-> Tutor : validate slot
Scheduling -[#2E5AA8]-> Student : resolve participant
Scheduling -[#6B7280,dashed]-> Rabbit : outbox events
Rabbit -[#6B7280,dashed]-> Notification : at-least-once
Notification --> NotificationDb

note bottom of Scheduling
DB exclusion constraints là lớp chống race cuối.
Không service nào đọc database của service khác.
end note
@enduml

